Ghosts are souls of dead beings that have not yet gone to the afterlife and appear to the living in the Pokémon world. They have appeared in various Pokémon media.

Ghosts are distinct from , who are often said to be reborn from such spirits. This distinction has existed since Generation I, which introduced Ghost-type Pokémon along with the s of Pokémon Tower.

